<title>LATVIA: FUR FIRM GROBINA ON BOURSE FREE LIST JULY 14.</title>
<headline>FUR FIRM GROBINA ON BOURSE FREE LIST JULY 14.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange on Thursday said that fur firm Grobina would join the free list of the bourse from July 14.</p>
<p>The bourse has 497,500 Grobina shares registered at a nominal price of one lat.</p>
<p>The main shareholder is a private person, who has 50.25 percent, while the privatisation agency has 5.30 percent.</p>
<p>The company had turnover in 1996 of 1.5 million lats and a profit of 187,445 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
